  revisitTitle: Psychic Waves
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  pages:
  - 'Last loop. Time for the closer: PSYCHIC WAVES, an ACTION card. It doesn''t touch
    the song: it hits the WHOLE crowd''s mind at once. It costs Inspiration. Play
    it before the loop ends. Every musician has their own closer; tonight it''s Sibi''s.
    The ending is everything.'
  highlightKey: card_psychic_waves
  mechanicText: 'Psychic Waves is an <link=action_card>action card</link>: costs
    <link=inspiration>Inspiration</link>, reduces every audience member''s <link=vibe>Vibe</link>
    at once and applies <link=earworm>Earworm</link>, which keeps reducing Vibe on
    later audience turns. It does not change the song. The tutorial waits for it
    on the last <link=loop>loop</link>.'
